WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.070
But I want to switch gear a
little bit in the talking about

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:06.370
another place where
intelligence would come up.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.830
That is really intelligent
digital assistant.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.310
Cortana, I want to
talk about Cortana.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.800
I'm sure by now you have heard
a lot of intelligent assistance.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.030
Popping up from many,

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.066
many companies you definitely
have a question that,

00:00:21.066 --> 00:00:24.530
so what's so unique about
the Microsoft Cortana.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.350
I tell you two things about
the Microsoft Cortana

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:28.728
that's really unique.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.930
Number one,
Cortana is really designed for

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:37.100
you to go across your work life,
your work and life.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.910
And as you can imagine that,
the lines between work and life.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.110
Are really blurry.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.150
Just think about that, your
email accounts that you use at

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.300
home and that you use at work.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.020
So this is why we
actually design Cortana

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.760
to be the best digital assistant
to help you to get things done.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.770
Whether at home,
at work or on the go.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:03.090
And for example, Cortana will
help you to find the emails and

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.300
to remind you your commitments.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.570
You may or
may not already forgotten.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.680
And the recommended
meeting times.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.280
Or shared accounts.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.790
So this is why that we
actually have now the support,

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:21.440
to really help you to work
across different email systems.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:26.150
So we actually now can work
in an added GMail support for

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:28.080
calendar and the email, so

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:33.000
that Cortana can help you get
across multiple email systems.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.890
So I'm very happy to announce
that we actually have this

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.050
ability today, in Cortana you
will see a demo very soon.

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:43.945
So the second thing very
unique about the Cortana,

00:01:43.945 --> 00:01:47.940
I want to share with you is
that it's not really about

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.600
our own Cortana devices only.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:54.010
So we really want to bring
Cortana to as many devices as

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.430
possible.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:56.490
And we, for example,

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.392
launched this Harman Kardon
speaker recently.

00:01:59.392 --> 00:02:04.390
With a beautiful voice quality
and all those digital assistance

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.620
qualities, and
the user experience.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:10.180
And we also announced
a partnership with Cortana and

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:12.920
Alexa, and with Amazon.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.960
Because we actually believe that
it's important that we offer

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.900
very unique user experience.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.770
Especially across work and
life on different devices.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:25.310
But that's not all,
we also wanted Cortana to appear

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:28.090
in as many applications
as possible.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:33.200
In whether it's Microsoft own
Windows, and Office, and others,

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:38.220
and all Android and iOS
applications in other platforms.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:42.260
So this why I'm so excited
to announce two new mobile

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.850
launchers on Android platform.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:49.208
Our own Microsoft launcher and
Cheetah Mobile.

00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:53.420
And our partner they
actually have one of those

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:58.220
top productivity launchers in
Android Google Play store.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:02.962
And the Cheetah Mobile Launcher
will be available immediate

00:03:02.962 --> 00:03:06.850
with our Cortana embedded and
the Microsoft Launcher will have

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.655
Cortana capability in
the couple of months.

00:03:09.655 --> 00:03:14.098
So, this integration with
Cortana is now we do that to

00:03:14.098 --> 00:03:17.966
help more people across
multiple platforms.

00:03:17.966 --> 00:03:21.239
It's really coming back to my
earlier point that is, you think

00:03:21.239 --> 00:03:24.580
about that the lines between
work and life getting blurred.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.830
Why did you need an assistant?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.590
Where did you need an assistant?

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:30.200
So, this is really
in our commitment,

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.210
to help people to get
things done even faster.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:38.080
So, one thing I want to remind
everyone is that as we design

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.360
those digital assistants,

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.130
like Cortana it's really
about the conversational AI.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.850
It's really not just about
you have one question, and

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.050
then you get an answer, and
then you get out of there.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:52.884
It's really encouraging you
to get into the dialogue.

00:03:52.884 --> 00:03:56.580
So I wanted to invite Kristina
to come up to show you some of

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.670
those interesting Cortana demos,
Kristina?

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:02.894
&gt;&gt; Thanks, Harry.

00:04:02.894 --> 00:04:03.997
So first and foremost,

00:04:03.997 --> 00:04:07.600
Cortana is a fantastic workplace
productivity assistant.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.470
It can help with things that
normally take a lot of time and

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.260
a lot of steps.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:16.510
One example is finding time
with my very busy VP, Jordi.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.320
Hey, Cortana,

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.898
set up a meeting called FY
18 goals with Jordi Ribas.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.321
&gt;&gt; Looks like you and

00:04:26.321 --> 00:04:31.080
Jordi are both free at 9:30
am on monday January 8th.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.859
When would you like to meet?

00:04:32.859 --> 00:04:34.770
&gt;&gt; 9:30 am on January 8th.

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:41.901
&gt;&gt; Okay I've scheduled this
FY 18 goals with you and

00:04:41.901 --> 00:04:48.253
Judy at 9:30 AM on Monday
January 8th, is that right?

00:04:48.253 --> 00:04:49.436
&gt;&gt; Yes.
&gt;&gt; Got it.

00:04:49.436 --> 00:04:51.260
&gt;&gt; January,
I told you he was busy.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.260
Before today I would have wasted
a lot of time going back and

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.790
forth trying to figure out
when we are both free.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.960
But now with Cortana, because
it understands my calendar and

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.530
Jordi's calendar, it can suggest
the time that's best for

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.090
both of us.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.720
Beyond a pure workplace
productivity assistant,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.990
we all know, as Harry said,
that the line between work and

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.150
home is blurring more and
more each day.

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:17.100
The real value in Cortana is
in its ability to move across

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.999
devices and across the different
aspects of our lives.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:22.340
It's difficult to
schedule a work

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.000
trip if you don't know what's
on your personal calendar.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.510
And we all know that sometimes
the most urgent email that you

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.710
receive during a work day
is from a family member, or

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:31.030
from a friend.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:34.770
Cortana summarizes across your
different email accounts.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:35.930
Hey, Cortana.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.342
What new emails do I have.

00:05:41.592 --> 00:05:44.606
&gt;&gt; You've got six new
email in the last hour,

00:05:44.606 --> 00:05:47.455
one from Haddon Park
marked important,

00:05:47.455 --> 00:05:51.010
three from Helm Williams and
two from Jodi Ribas.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.080
Which center do you
wanna hear more about?

00:05:55.889 --> 00:05:59.362
&gt;&gt; Adam please
&gt;&gt; Adam core email view about

00:05:59.362 --> 00:06:00.529
holidays.

00:06:00.529 --> 00:06:02.770
Marked important.

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.289
Wanna hear it?

00:06:04.289 --> 00:06:04.917
&gt;&gt; Yes, please.

00:06:07.859 --> 00:06:11.154
&gt;&gt; It says Don't forget
to buy cirque tickets for

00:06:11.154 --> 00:06:13.100
your parents visit.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.531
What do you think
about a Friday?

00:06:15.531 --> 00:06:18.790
Answer me,
what should I do with this?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:19.828
Reply or nothing?

00:06:19.828 --> 00:06:22.539
&gt;&gt; Nothing.

00:06:22.539 --> 00:06:24.240
&gt;&gt; All right.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.555
&gt;&gt; We are all
really busy people.

00:06:26.555 --> 00:06:28.699
But because Cortana
blends my work and

00:06:28.699 --> 00:06:32.319
personal life by reaching across
my different email accounts.

00:06:32.319 --> 00:06:34.780
I can take care of
things as they come up.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.860
Of course I could set a reminder
and take care of this later.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.770
But there is no time
like the present.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:40.660
The problem is,

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.038
I don't actually remember when
my parents are coming to town.

00:06:44.038 --> 00:06:45.599
Hey, Cortana.

00:06:45.599 --> 00:06:47.320
Find mom and dad on my calendar.

00:06:52.079 --> 00:06:55.103
&gt;&gt; You have mom and dad visiting
at Seattle from Wednesday,

00:06:55.103 --> 00:06:57.820
December 20th to Wednesday,
December 27th.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:00.970
&gt;&gt; Okay.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:04.181
Because Cortana is about
helping you wherever you are.

00:07:04.181 --> 00:07:08.477
It's support integration across
calendars with Office 365,

00:07:08.477 --> 00:07:10.480
Outlook, and now even Gmail.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.240
Hey, Cortana.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.540
Help me find tickets to Cirque
Dreams Holidaze in Seattle on

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:17.552
December, 22n d.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.620
&gt;&gt; I have 3 skills
that can help you.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.050
Ticketmaster, Gigseeker,
and Stub Hub.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.290
Which do you want to use.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:33.785
&gt;&gt; Ticketmaster please.

00:07:33.785 --> 00:07:34.844
&gt;&gt; Okay.

00:07:34.844 --> 00:07:36.934
Opening Ticketmaster.

00:07:36.934 --> 00:07:41.032
I found Cirque Dreams Holidaze
in Seattle on December 22nd at

00:07:41.032 --> 00:07:41.971
7:30 PM.

00:07:41.971 --> 00:07:43.606
Tickets are $40 to $80.

00:07:43.606 --> 00:07:50.160
Do you want to pick your seat or
buy the best seats available?

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.510
&gt;&gt; Best seats available please.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.275
&gt;&gt; Okay,
how many seats do you need?

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:57.260
&gt;&gt; Four, please.

00:08:00.695 --> 00:08:03.650
&gt;&gt; Okay,
I found four seats row D.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:04.855
Seats six to nine.

00:08:04.855 --> 00:08:07.781
Sound good?

00:08:07.781 --> 00:08:08.414
&gt;&gt; Yes.

00:08:12.073 --> 00:08:15.457
&gt;&gt; Okay, I have four seats for
Cirque Dreams Holidaze

00:08:15.457 --> 00:08:18.604
at the Paramount Theater
in Seattle on Friday,

00:08:18.604 --> 00:08:20.820
December 22nd at 7:30 PM.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.520
The total comes out to $394.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.694
Say confirm to purchase.

00:08:27.694 --> 00:08:28.194
&gt;&gt; Confirm.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:33.300
&gt;&gt; Okay, you're all set.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.600
Would you like me to add
this to your calendar?

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.469
&gt;&gt; Yes.
Please also invite Adam.

00:08:42.127 --> 00:08:44.626
Okay, I've sent this
event to Adam Kirk and

00:08:44.626 --> 00:08:46.190
added it to your calendar.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.930
&gt;&gt; Thank you for letting
me get that taken care of.

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.930
Now let me walk you through some
of the cool things that just

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:53.090
happened here.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:56.190
Instead of me needing to know
which specific skill to ask for,

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.760
Cortana used skill suggestion to

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.170
connect me to the best
place to buy tickets.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.180
And then connected me to
the that third party skill.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:07.020
And because of my, I have my
credit card information with

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:10.370
ticket Master, my purchase
process was a breeze.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:13.660
Cortana then use a new feature
called skill chaining,

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:16.550
which understand my
overall intent to help me

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.960
find the next most
relevant skill.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:22.290
In this case, it was adding
an events to my calendar.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.340
How great was that?

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:26.690
Using my voice, Cortana was able
to help me be super productive

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.830
in both work and at home.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.010
All of this done hands-free.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.130
This calendar feature
is available now.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.220
The next generation of
our Cortana skills kit is

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.960
also available today.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.520
And the email features that
we demoed today will be

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.389
available next month.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.384
But of course Cortana can help
you in more places than just

00:09:45.384 --> 00:09:46.783
this great speaker.

00:09:46.783 --> 00:09:50.238
Here's a quick look in some of
the places that Cortana can help

00:09:50.238 --> 00:09:51.890
you be more productive.

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:56.223
And get things done across
Windows, Edge, Skype and

00:09:56.223 --> 00:09:58.446
the new mobile launchers.

00:09:58.446 --> 00:10:01.770
[MUSIC]

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:08.865
&gt;&gt; Hey,

00:10:08.865 --> 00:10:18.865
Cortana,

00:10:21.638 --> 00:10:30.153
play my

00:10:30.153 --> 00:10:37.249
dance

00:10:37.249 --> 00:10:44.349
mix.

00:10:44.349 --> 00:10:51.319
[MUSIC]

00:10:51.319 --> 00:10:53.495
&gt;&gt; I booked your workout for
6:00 pm tonight.

00:10:53.495 --> 00:10:54.995
Can I get you a ride?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:05.015
[MUSIC]

00:11:05.015 --> 00:11:05.850
Hey Cortana.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:06.350
What's next?

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:12.403
&gt;&gt; It's really amazing to
see how Cortana has evolved

00:11:12.403 --> 00:11:15.230
into a really powerful
digital assistant.

